\item \textbf{Source-interface record verifier.} Command: \path{python review_bundle/verify_source_interface_record.py}; source state: current local automath checkout at the recorded package state; environment: Python 3.10.11 on Windows 10 except for the PowerShell web check and digest wrapper where stated in the log; exit code: \path{0}; log path: \path{review_bundle/source_interface_verification_run.log}; boundary: finite table, JSON, manifest-range, label, digest, and line-count comparison only; no Lean rebuild or imported-source semantic validation.
\item \textbf{Primary-claim inventory verifier.} Command: \path{python review_bundle/verify_primary_claim_inventory.py}; source state: current local automath checkout at the recorded package state; environment: Python 3.10.11 on Windows 10 except for the PowerShell web check and digest wrapper where stated in the log; exit code: \path{0}; log path: \path{review_bundle/primary_claim_inventory_freshness_2026-06-08.log}; boundary: primary-source line-span, row-shape, row-id, and certificate-pointer check only; no proof of primary prose semantics.
\item \textbf{Theorem-environment extractor.} Command: \path{python review_bundle/extract_theorem_environments.py}; source state: current local automath checkout at the recorded package state; environment: Python 3.10.11 on Windows 10 except for the PowerShell web check and digest wrapper where stated in the log; exit code: \path{0}; log path: \path{review_bundle/theorem_environment_extraction_run.log}; boundary: syntactic theorem-like environment extraction and inventory-label coverage only; no proof semantics, Lean rebuild, daemon run, or artifact validation.
